    - target: {fileID: 7222691419828877991, guid: cdf805fec9c199045ba01bc8b49027ed, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Valued assistant,\r\n\r\nArthur brought to my attention that you had
        noticed someone impersonating me. I want to personally thank you and ensure
        you that this issue has been taken care of. \r\n\r\nOn a different note,
        you don\u2019t have to avoid making eye contact with me. The rumours of me
        casting vanishing spells left and right is a cruel joke on new employees
        by my old friend Vincent Crysologus.\r\n\r\nCarry on with the good work,\n\r\n"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
